This licence covers the code in this repository only.

The corpus in `apps/api/data/speeches.jsonl` is NOT covered by it. That file is
derived from a third-party dataset distributed under the Apache License 2.0, and
carries its own attribution and licence:

    Dataset:  ambedkar-speech-corpus
    Source:   https://huggingface.co/datasets/sanjeevafk/ambedkar-speech-corpus
    Licence:  Apache-2.0

The text stored in the archive is an unverified secondary summary of each cited
source. It is not a primary transcription, and nothing in this repository should
be read as asserting that it is one. See `docs/HONESTY.md` for what the archive
does and does not claim.
